{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1759350205\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1759350205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1759350205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Heaven's Dale needs you...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are left in Heaven's Dale with one goal in mind: Build a life, and along the way, help the people in your community!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/d767d2dee8f0c58c39f0378650b9502d.avif?t=1759350205\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>A peaceful life...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">My Heaven's Dale offers simple gameplay: gather resources, earn money, build improvements throughout the community, and watch your progress grow every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.poster.avif?t=1759350205\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.webm?t=1759350205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.mp4?t=1759350205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each day of the week has different relaxing music to keep you from getting tired! After all, you\u2019ll have <strong>plenty of time</strong> to do whatever you need until nightfall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You are not alone!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You don\u2019t need to live alone with your cats forever! (Unless you want to!). There are many residents to befriend, and even marriage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cffc942a7372788ec2f6e4bfeff3b2aa.avif?t=1759350205\" width=725 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/f6078a07593423e4747ca20c163452e7.avif?t=1759350205\" width=739 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>There\u2019s so much to do...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become a fisherman; Explore caves; Gather resources in the forest; Grow your crops; Build your ranch; Travel to the moon; Complete upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/562f161efcb9bbf63a43424d215c69ed.avif?t=1759350205\" width=1560 height=518 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant crops right next to your house or build a Giant Greenhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use barrels to increase the value of your crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy chickens, cows, pigs, goats, and ducks for your ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more than 7 unique pets to live with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with over 30 unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch more than 90 types of fish while picking your next song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multi-floor caves with different types of gems to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn recipes and complete your Achievement Hall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 girls or boys to marry and have children with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the Moon, build a house, and meet new creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy new days with different music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in festivals that bring the whole community together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets hidden all across Heaven's Dale.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mail for contact: <a href=\"mailto:myheavensdale@gmail.com\">myheavensdale@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/13736374df2d747303a150a1f73ab8bb.avif?t=1759350205\" width=630 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image